flowchart LR
    H[Human User\nOwner/Pet/Task Inputs]
    UI[Streamlit UI\napp.py]
    V[Input Validation and Guardrails\nTask checks and bounds]
    A[Scheduling Agent\nPlan -> Critique -> Refine]
    S[Deterministic Scheduler\nPriority and time-slot logic]
    LLM[LLM Provider\nReasoning and critique]
    C[Conflict and Safety Validator\nOverlap and rule checks]
    O[Output\nSchedule table + warnings + rationale]
    T[Tester and Evaluator\npytest + reliability scenarios]
    R[Test Report\nPass/fail and consistency metrics]

    H --> UI --> V --> A
    A --> S
    A <--> LLM
    S --> C --> O --> H

    T --> UI
    T --> A
    T --> C
    T --> R

    C -->|invalid AI plan| S
    H -->|review and adjust inputs| UI
